    "ece": "10 equal-width confidence bins across [0,1], bin weight n/203, gap abs(mean max softmax probability minus bin accuracy); empty bins weight 0.",
    "entropy": "Mean predictive entropy over six class probabilities, natural logs.",
    "high_confidence": "Maximum predicted class probability at least 0.5."
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Training-only case-grouped out-of-fold probabilities and exploratory model selection; calibration quantities are not clinical reliability estimates.",
    "Different calibration across classifiers may reflect training algorithms rather than the quantum feature representation.",
    "No calibration method was fitted and no threshold was optimized.",
    "No independent patient-level test was examined.",
    "SVC internal probability calibration uses training-fold data, not nested case-grouped calibration."
